      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lewisporte",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2019 a new roll‑on, roll‑off ferry from Happy Valley-Goose Bay replaced freight shipping that had operated out of Lewisporte.",
